# Unreal Engine generated / transient trees for the demo project.
#
# This mirrors the root .gitignore's UE section, scoped to demo/ so a demo
# editor open never leaves a dirty tree. The root .gitignore already covers
# these names globally; this file is the belt-and-braces copy for anyone who
# copies demo/ out of the repo standalone.

# UBT / engine build output
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Script/

# IDE / project files generated by UBT
.vs/
*.sln
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# Per-user editor state
*.log

# Validation Suite — disposable per-scenario fixtures staged under Content.
# Operator state (Saved/ValidationSuite/) is already covered by Saved/ above.
Content/_ValidationSuite/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
